  type="Technical method"
  title="Certifying paired-t numerical evidence before protocol support"
  description="We built and independently reviewed a proof pipeline for paired-t p-values and critical values before deciding what nomue Protocol will support."
  published="August 28, 2026"
  status="Reviewed candidate evidence — not protocol support"
